# A private signing key must never be committed, not even a test one. Generate
# real keys outside the working tree (or into /tmp); anything under this path,
# if used for local experimentation, is ignored as a second line of defence.
.private/
*.pem
*_private.key

# Generated by scripts/build-catalog.mjs and signed in CI. Committed back to
# main by the publish workflow, never by hand.
catalog.json
catalog.json.sig
